  "description": "XSLT 3.0, XSLT 2.0 and XPath 3.1 processor for .NET, compiled to IL. Built on the engine behind System.Xml.Xsl.XslCompiledTransform and keeps its API, so XSLT 1.0 stylesheets run unchanged with identical output. Adds maps, arrays and higher-order functions, xsl:try, xsl:iterate, xsl:merge, accumulators, packages, JSON functions and json/adaptive/HTML5 output. Includes xsl:evaluate and xsl:assert, secure by default: dynamic evaluation, secondary result files and environment variables are opt-in settings. Schema awareness (XSD 1.0) is opt-in; streaming isn't supported yet.",
